11	// Regression coverage for a batch that deletes a SHARED intermediate dataset
12	// while the retained downstream is rewired onto surviving upstreams within the
13	// same plan.
14	//
15	// The fixture keeps two converging branches:
16	//
17	//	R -> M -> B -> H -> T
18	//	     \-> C -/     (H also depends on C, so the branches meet at H)
